  "description": "*“Why am I naked in bed with another man…?”* \n\nJae-Woo reluctantly attends his high school reunion and he can’t wait to leave. But after seeing someone he thought he’d never meet again, he ends up drinking himself into a stupor. The next day, Jae-Woo wakes up next to Si-Yeon, the boy that was pining after him throughout high school. This is Si-Yeon’s chance to pounce! He offers Jae-Woo a deal, one month of dating, after which things can end amicably, no questions asked. But as rumors start spreading about the circumstances surrounding the reunion, Jae-Woo starts becoming suspicious of Si-Yeon’s true intentions… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
